  "abstract_summary": "ShipYOLO is a lightweight graphical software for small-target vessel detection in maritime scenarios, developed based on YOLO (You Only Look Once) models. It supports multi-source file detection, customizable confidence thresholds, automatic result storage, and real-time Excel export. With low hardware requirements...",
